### G2. DPIA review triggers

| Trigger | Action |
|---------|--------|
| New feature collecting personal data (accounts, favourites, saved searches) | New DPIA or addendum |
| Change of hosting provider (away from Vercel) | Re-assess R3 |
| Addition of analytics/tracking (GA, Plausible, etc.) | New DPIA — likely high risk |
| Landlord dashboard (landlord logs in, manages listings) | New DPIA — controller for landlord data |
| Payment integration (deposits, rent) | New DPIA — financial data, high risk |
| ODPC guidance update | Review against new guidance |
| Security incident involving personal data | Incident response → DPIA update |

