## Appendix C — Technical Implementation Evidence (Audit Fixes)

The following security and performance fixes were implemented and verified via build/lint (commit `FIX ALL: Security + Performance audit fixes`):

### Security Fixes (4)
1. **CampusMap.tsx** — XSS fix: marker/popup content sanitised; MapLibre instance cleaned up on unmount.
2. **VideoPanel.tsx** — Removed `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`; added `isValidColor()` validation for CSS custom properties.
3. **MarketingChrome.tsx** — `WHATSAPP_URL` from `import.meta.env.VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER` with validation; all external links have `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.
4. **vercel.json** — Added CSP (`default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org https://server.arcgisonline.com https://api.mapbox.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'`), `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, `X-Frame-Options: DENY`, `Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin`, `Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()`.

### Performance Fixes (7)
1. **useReducedMotion.ts** — Module singleton with `useSyncExternalStore` (no re-renders on context change).
2. **useIntersectionObserver.ts** — `IntersectionObserverSingleton` class: shared observers keyed by `(rootMargin, threshold)`.
3. **useBatchedVideoAutoplay.ts** — `BatchedVideoManager`: single `requestAnimationFrame` loop for all videos.
4. **VideoPanel.tsx** — Uses shared hooks above.
5. **Experience.tsx** — `ScrollProgress` throttled with rAF; `JourneyRail` cleanup on unmount.
6. **ListingGrid.tsx** — Stable `listing.id` keys (from `src/data/listings.ts`).
7. **Residence clips lazy-load** — `residenceClips.ts` extracted; dynamic `import()` in `index.tsx` on mount.

