## Appendix D — Architecture Context (for DPO Review)

| Layer | Technology | Data Protection Relevance |
|-------|------------|---------------------------|
| **Framework** | TanStack Start (SSR) + React 19 + TypeScript | No server state; pure SSR → static HTML + client hydration. No session cookies. |
| **Routing** | TanStack Router (file-based) | No route-level auth. All pages public. |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS 4 + CSS Variables (oklch) | No runtime style injection. CSP `style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'` only for Tailwind JIT. |
| **Map** | MapLibre GL 5.24 | Keyless providers. Map mounts on scroll (IntersectionObserver). No `navigator.geolocation` used. |
| **Video** | Native `<video>` + IntersectionObserver + BatchedVideoManager | Muted, playsinline, loop. Autoplay only when visible. Respects `prefers-reduced-motion` and `saveData`. |
| **Hosting** | Vercel (Nitro `vercel` preset) | Edge functions for SSR. Static assets in `.vercel/output/static`. DPA + SCCs required. |
| **Editor Sync** | Lovable (GitHub `main` branch) | No production data in repo. Lovable sees code only. |
| **Assets** | Local MP4/WebP in `public/ads/`, `src/assets/` | No CDN for video (cost control). Total <20MB. Lazy-loaded. |

